			(property "Description" "AP3012\n\nThe AP3012 is a high power, constant frequency, current mode PWM, inductor based, step-up (boost) converter. The converter operates at high frequency (1.5MHz) so that a small, low profile inductor can be used.\n\nDatasheet"
